    "reservations each keeps. wire_lock_test.go fails when one moves, changes kind or goes; a new one is additive, and",
    "SIDECAR_REGENERATE_WIRE_LOCK=1 go test -run '^TestWireLockHolds$' ./protocol adds it here, changing no line already",
    "here. Kinds read 'repeated ' first for a list, and a message's or enum's full name after its kind."
